{"id":"d8a892f85575c609","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-many-sorted-signature.md","title":"Many-sorted signature","display":"df-many-sorted-signature — Many-sorted signature","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-many-sorted-signature","aliases":["56-df-many-sorted-signature"],"display":"df-many-sorted-signature — Many-sorted signature","depends_on":["[[56-df-signature]]"],"source_section":"§3.4.3; §6.5.6","source_printed_pages":"77–78, 256","source_ocr_blocks":[98,99,277],"source_verification":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-many-sorted-signature"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-many-sorted-signature</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-sorted-signature — Many-sorted signature"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53c31cee4a64d821\" href=\"?note=53c31cee4a64d821\" title=\"56-df-signature\">56-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.4.3; §6.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"77–78, 256"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>98</span><span>99</span><span>277</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为非空有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 为非空函数符号集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathcal F\\to S^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(a:\\mathcal F\\to S^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathcal F\\to S\">\\(b:\\mathcal F\\to S\\)</span> 为函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n\">\\(S^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n\\)</span>，包括空序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|w|\">\\(|w|\\)</span> 为有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 的长度。无排序签名的记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sig}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sig}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"53c31cee4a64d821\" href=\"?note=53c31cee4a64d821\" title=\"56-df-signature\">56-df-signature</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\coloneqq(S,\\mathcal F,a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\coloneqq(S,\\mathcal F,a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}(f)\\coloneqq|a(f)|\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}(f)\\coloneqq|a(f)|\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\circ}\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sig}(\\Sigma^{\\circ}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma^{\\circ}\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sig}(\\Sigma^{\\circ}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ManySorted}(M)\\iff|S|&gt;1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OneSorted}(M)\\iff|S|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ManySorted}(M)\\iff|S|&gt;1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OneSorted}(M)\\iff|S|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(f)\">\\(a(f)\\)</span> 是各参数位置的排序序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(f)\">\\(b(f)\\)</span> 是输出排序。无排序的底层签名只保留序列长度；此时尚未对项施加排序约束。这里每个函数符号只有一个输入排序序列与一个输出排序，不采用重载或子排序。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§3.4.3，印刷第77–78页，OCR页块98–99；§6.5.6，印刷第256页，OCR页块277。有限排序集约定取自§6.5.6，原书的 ar、st 分别对应本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\circ}\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\circ}\\)</span> 是便于复用本目录一阶项语法的本地接口。已比对文字层中的排序签名陈述；OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"53c31cee4a64d821","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"53c31cee4a64d821","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n$，包括空序列；$|w|$ 为有限序列 $w$ 的长度。无排序签名的记号 $\\operatorname{Sig}$ 见 [[56-df-signature]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathcal F\\to S^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"b:\\mathcal F\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"S^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n","display":false},{"tex":"|w|","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sig}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\coloneqq(S,\\mathcal F,a,b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}(f)\\coloneqq|a(f)|\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\circ}\\coloneqq(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar}^{\\circ}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sig}(\\Sigma^{\\circ}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ManySorted}(M)\\iff|S|>1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OneSorted}(M)\\iff|S|=1.","display":true},{"tex":"a(f)","display":false},{"tex":"b(f)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\circ}","display":false}],"bytes":1914,"backlinks":[{"id":"0eb06f5a064870f0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(S,\\mathcal F,a,b)$、$\\Sigma^{\\circ}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-signature]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-326","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-signature.md]]"}],"outgoing":["53c31cee4a64d821"]}